From c989d107b028eeb1d1fe1f8bbef3994e50a087f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Carney <tim.carney@cargt.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 09:54:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] board/cargt(imx93_00363): runtime DRAM selection; DDRC and
 FSP rank-2 overrides in SPL

---
 board/cargt/imx93_00363/Kconfig     |   1 +
 board/cargt/imx93_00363/Makefile    |   2 +
 board/cargt/imx93_00363/spl-cargt.c | 178 ++++++++++++++++++++++------
 3 files changed, 148 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

